# The "duck" setting on FX2: a saw sent to the track pumps with a sequenced note on every beat.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.3
track fx2
input saw 55 0.5
preset 48 64 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C4 1 127
note 4 C4 1 127
note 8 C4 1 127
note 12 C4 1 127
expect sound 0 16
expect peak_below -0.1
